config VIDEO_V4L2LOOPBACK
	tristate "Virtual video loopback devices (v4l2loopback)"
	depends on VIDEO_DEV
	help
	  Video devices that a program writes frames into and others read
	  them from as a camera. Imported from v4l2loopback v0.15.4
	  (https://github.com/umlaeute/v4l2loopback).

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called v4l2loopback.
